{"articleNo":"423031","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=423031&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] [2022년 대학혁신지원사업] 대학원생 학술활동 참가비 지원 마감예정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.01.20","hit":"8108","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><font face=\"HCI Poppy\">대학원생 학술활동 참가비 지원은 당초 안내된 바와 같이&nbsp;</font><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2023. 1. 31.까지 참가한 학술대회에 한하여 지원</span></b>됩니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><font face=\"HCI Poppy\">곧 예산마감이 진행됨에 따라 <b>2023. 1월 학술대회 등 참가비 지원 발생분이 있으면&nbsp;</b></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; text-indent: -15.1pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학과행정실로 2023. 2. 8.(수)까지 제출해주시기 바랍니다. (학과행정실을 통해 대학원지원팀으로 2. 10.(금)까지 제출되어야 합니다)</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; text-indent: -20.1333px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; text-indent: -20.1333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">예산 마감시기 임박에 따라</span> 잔여예산 확인을 위하여 2023. 1월 참가비가 발생(학술대회 참가)한 경우&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -15.1pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.1pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;;\"><b>1. 27.(금)까지 054-478-7039</b>로 학술대회 참가비 발생에 대한 사항을 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>유선</b></span>으로 먼저 알려주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.1pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;;\">(유선 연락이 없을 경우, 예산지원이 불가할 수도 있으니 협조해주시기 바랍니다)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -15.1pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -15.1pt;\">------------------------(이전 안내사항이오니 참고하세요)---------------------------------------------------------------------</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">년 대학혁신지원사업 대학원생 학술활동 참가비 지원 계획을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -15.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 90.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -90.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">지원범위</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2022. 3. 1. ~ 2023. 1. 31.[11개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">동안 국내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">외에서 열리는&nbsp;<b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학회 학술</span></b></span><b><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">대회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;학회&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">기술특강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">강좌 등의 대학원생 참가비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">등록비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">지원</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 90.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -90.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span><strong><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">인당 최대&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">천원&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕; text-indent: -90.6pt;\">(2022. 2월 참여 실적에 대해서는 지원 불가)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 91.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -91.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">교육 및 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">석사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">박사 및 석</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">박사 통합과정 재학생&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">수료생은 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 89.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -89.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">학술대회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">기술특강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">강좌 등 종료 후&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">주일 이내&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 89.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -89.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 단, 2022. 3월 ~ 6월 참가분은 7. 8.(금)까지 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 89.9pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -89.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※ 지원금 지급은 7월 이후 예정이며, 지급 시기가 조정될 경우 별도 안내 예정</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">지원금 신청서 및 결과보고서 각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">증빙서류포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한양중고딕;\">1]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">참고 /&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 한양중고딕;\">&nbsp;제출서류를 구비하여 학과로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 92.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -92.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">연구비 등 다른 예산과 중복 수혜 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">추후 중복지급이 확인될 경우 회수 조치</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 92.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -92.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 92.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -92.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">** 증빙서류 제출시, 현금영수증(학교 사업자등록번호 지출증빙) 또는 세금계산서 필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 92.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -92.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 해외 학회의 경우 현금영수증, 세금계산서 발급이 불가할 경우 학회&nbsp;등록 전 대학원 사전 상담 요망(054-478-7039)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
